		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一切重来，但更丰富</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism 止步于终极。Evolved 则继续前进，为该模组中每种线缆、储罐、方块、容器、工厂和电路再增加四个等级，最终达到一个荒谬至极的程度。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还添加了Mekanism没有的四种机器：金属铸造系统、三种新的齿轮材料，以及一个吞噬反物质的巨型多方块结构。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>从哪里开始</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>左</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 是四台新机器和它们使用的模具。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>正中间的位置</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是合金梯子，它控制着其他所有区域。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>下面</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是新的齿轮材料和能制作其中一个的转换器。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>四层网格位于独立章节，可从任一电路进入。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 这里没有任何强制要求。所有东西都是对你已建造内容的直接升级。"
				"{ \"text\": \"Back to Mekanism\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#3FA9C8\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"23983F4DC524B14B\" } }"
				"{ \"text\": \"Open the tier chapter\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#B47CFF\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2F7C58B1A4E36D09\" } }"
			]
			icon: "evolvedmekanism:quantum_logistical_transporter"
			id: "4CAB5A327810DF8A"
			min_width: 360
			size: 1.6d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B47CFF to=#B47CFF>更远的地方</grad>"
			tasks: [{
