			x: 0.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4716EC91D45AF20A"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>63 个物品栏格位</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism 提供了一款个人储物箱。经过进阶升级，这款储物箱可容纳 </grad><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>63</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个物品栏。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它被破坏时内容物会保留，并且会锁定在你身上，这正是个人储物值得随身携带的原因所在。</grad></shadow>"
			]
