		{
			dependencies: ["4CAB5A327810DF8A"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>物品转化为流体</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>能量熔炉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和一个 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>组合器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>被集成到钢制外壳中。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它将物品融合在一起，是所有其他进化机器建造的基础。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "545060746B8763C7"
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B47CFF to=#B47CFF>熔炼，机器一</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6F68E430EA003789"
				item: "evolvedmekanism:alloyer"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6>合金器</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.4d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["26AAB0D4927D586B"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>第四台机器</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用单一合金和密集电路重建的 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>合金器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，因此这个出现的很晚。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它将物品与气体而非其他物品进行合金化，是制作</grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>Plaslitherite</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的唯一方法，而后者是合金阶梯的最后一环。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5C57BBF38F09BAFC"
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B47CFF to=#B47CFF>合金化，使用气体</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3005C8251B57DE21"
				item: "evolvedmekanism:chemixer"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6>Chemixer</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["545060746B8763C7"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>融化中</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>电阻加热器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和一个钢制外壳中的岩浆桶。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用包里几乎任何金属喂养它，都会得到熔融流体。这个图书馆内容庞大，涵盖了一百多种材料，几乎囊括了你安装的所有模组。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>这也是下界之星如何变成以太气体的方式。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "2060B38096DEDC52"
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B47CFF to=#B47CFF>金属，但呈液态</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3F33DAE876843A30"
				item: "evolvedmekanism:thermalizer"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6>Thermalizer</grad></shadow>"
			x: -5.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2060B38096DEDC52"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>将流体变回物品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>钢制外壳内的蓝冰和水桶。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>给它熔化的金属和</grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>模具</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，它就会返还你模具所描述的形状。锭、金块、宝石、粉尘、板、棒、线、齿轮、硬币和完整的存储方块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它需要氧气和金属，量与所设流体相同。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 模具不会被消耗。每种模具只需制作一次。"
			]
