				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>作为一个方块，它是一个下界合金方块，需要三个 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>聚乙烯片</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>900个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>锂。</grad></shadow>"
