		{
			dependencies: ["5C57BBF38F09BAFC"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>阳光倍增器</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>萤石粉、单一合金和硅石玻璃。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>安装在太阳能发电机中的每一个都会使发电量倍增。一个使其翻倍，两个使其三倍，三个使其四倍。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 这同样适用于普通太阳能发电机，而不仅仅是进化版。"
			]
			id: "5368D0483F60B963"
			optional: true
			shape: "circle"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#F2C14E to=#F2C14E>让太阳加倍闪耀</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "06047B8EB2C401BF"
				item: "evolvedmekanism:upgrade_solar"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6>太阳能升级</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["28422F62814F8BA4"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>变废为宝</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个空心的 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>APT外壳</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，带有用于物品进出的 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>APT端口</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和为其提供能量的 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>超充元件</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>外壳本身是通过核合成器用 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>50</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 反物质处理的 SPS 外壳，所以在放置第一块之前，这个多区块结构就已经很贵了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>功能说明</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它用放射性气体将物品转化。主要配方是：</grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>金锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 加上 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>核废料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，产出 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>Better Gold</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每锭消耗 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 废料，每块消耗 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>900</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 废料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>输入储罐可容纳 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>5,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>配方需要 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>200</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 刻，时长取决于消耗的气体量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能缓冲 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>10,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，并在运行时每秒消耗 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>100,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 核废料在桶中不会衰变。这台机器终于能让你知道该怎么处理它了。"
			]
			id: "0838D63F30A1322A"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [{
				exclude_from_claim_all: true
				id: "5285764F759019E3"
				type: "random"
			}]
