				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>单个</grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>多元宇宙感应单元</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可容纳十六千垓。是基础模组最佳单元的四千倍。</grad></shadow>"
