		{
			dependencies: ["2060B38096DEDC52"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>铸造图书馆</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Thermalizer 熔化，Solidification Chamber 启动。它们之间处理着一堆荒谬的材料，而且大部分甚至都不是来自 Mekanism 的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>钢铁、铜、金、下界合金、魔钢、泰拉钢、信号石、末地石、德拉科尼姆、至高合金、中子星合金、无限合金以及大约一百种其他材料，都有它们的熔融形态。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>数量</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个金块是 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>10</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个锭、一个粉尘或一个板需要 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>90</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一根棒子或一根线是 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>45</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>齿轮是 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>360</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而完整方块是 </grad><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>810</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 熔炼齿轮并将其铸成九个锭，是一种任何配方都无法实现的合法分解物品的方法。"
			]
